# Payroll Management System (Frontend)

A frontend-based Payroll Management System built using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.  
This project demonstrates employee management, salary calculation, and payslip generation in a modular structure.

## 🔹 Features
- Employee add & list
- Payroll calculation
- Payslip generation
- Dashboard view
- Frontend login (demo)

## 🔹 Tech Stack
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

## 🔹 Project Type
Frontend / Static Web Application

## 🔹 Live Demo
https://USERNAME.github.io/payroll-management-system/

## 🔹 How to Run Locally
1. Clone the repository
2. Open `index.html` in a browser

## 🔹 Note
This is a frontend-only project built for learning and portfolio purposes.
